## Approval gate
- A feature is built only when the user has set `Status: approved` in `docs/business-prd.md`, `docs/architecture.md`, that feature's own `docs/features/e-N-<slug>/business-prd.md` and its `technical-prd.md`. The test strategy and the test plans are not gated. Until then no code, tests or configuration are written for it. Agents never set it and never edit an approved document. Check: `.claude/scripts/check-approval.sh` (all documents) or `--for E-N` (one feature).

